# The files an older tehas installed that this one does not, as paths under
# $TEHAS_HOME. install.sh finds each one there and removes it once systemd has
# the new units (console update retired, src/update/report.rs). One path a
# line, in the order --check names them; a line from # is a comment.
#
# The commands of before bin/tehas, one file each in bin/, and the console of
# before it was a compiled program. The libraries the bash poll sourced. The
# Protolab's server files of before the edge router. The wrappers of what is
# now a verb of the console, the libraries of what is now a verb of
# tehas-cycle, and the jq program of the bash report. The libraries whose last
# callers moved into the console, the scripts that only exec'd it, the release
# list of before it was a plain file (lib/release.list), and the scripts that
# took a lock for tehas-cycle, which takes it itself.
bin/tehas-console.ts
bin/tehas-dispatch
bin/tehas-energy
bin/tehas-health
bin/tehas-index
bin/tehas-protolab
bin/tehas-status
bin/tehas-test
